  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien 1930s ryukoka revival, an early-1930s Taiwanese salon foxtrot. Violin and mandolin playing the melody in unison; a clarinet countermelody between the vocal phrases; upright piano comping on the off-beats; upright bass in a two-beat foxtrot; a light period dance-band drum set with woodblock and brushed snare. Small-room sound, narrow and slightly band-limited like an old 78 record but clean, the vocal close and forward. Light, clear female soprano with precise diction and a slight shimmer of vibrato, bright and coquettish phrasing. 116 BPM, G major. Giddy, shy and a little scheming. No big-band horn section, no swing ride cymbal, no enka kobushi or sobbing, no modern drum kit, no trap hi-hats, no synth, no autotune.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n禮拜六 暗時七點\n摩天輪 一輾十七分\n戒指 藏佇我的皮包底\n我算好 上懸彼一分鐘\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n伊講 伊無驚懸\n規雙跤 煞咇咇掣\n\n[Chorus]\n一輾十七分 慢慢仔起\n車廂 搖一下 伊喝一聲\n目睭瞌牢牢 手共我掠牢牢\n戒指 猶藏佇皮包底\n\n[Verse]\n落來 我閣買兩張票\n伊面青青 講「好啊 無要緊」\n講稿 我佇心內 唸幾若遍\n車廂 閣慢慢仔 起去上懸\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n伊講 伊無驚懸\n喙 煞一直唸阿彌陀佛\n\n[Chorus]\n一輾十七分 慢慢仔起\n車廂 搖一下 伊喝一聲\n目睭瞌牢牢 手共我掠牢牢\n我煞 笑甲講袂出喙\n\n[Bridge]\n上懸彼一分鐘 我提出戒指\n伊的目睭 猶瞌牢牢\n我共戒指 套入伊的指頭仔\n伊無看 就講「好!」\n\n[Chorus]\n一輾十七分 慢慢仔落\n伊目睭擘開 看指頭仔\n問我 頭拄仔講好 敢算數\n我講 落車進前 毋准反悔\n\n[Outro]\n落車 伊雙跤猶咧咇咇掣\n手 共我牽甲牢牢牢",
